==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|находи́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-находиться.ogg}}

===Etymology 1===
{{af|ru|находи́ть|t1=to [[find]]|-ся}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|находи́ться|impf|pf=найти́сь}}

# to be [[found]], to [[turn up]]
# to be [[located]], to be [[situated]] {{q|no perfective form}}
# to be in some condition {{q|no perfective form}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''находи́ться''' [[на]] [[распу́тье]]|to be at a crossroads}}
# to happen to have, to be found, to be discovered
#: {{pf|ru|найти́сь}}
# {{infl of|ru|находи́ть||pass}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ru-conj|impf|4c|находи́ться}}

===Etymology 2===
{{af|ru|на-|t1=to [[repletion]], to [[satiation]], to the [[full]]|ходи́ть|t2=to [[walk]]|-ся}}

====Verb====
{{ru-verb|находи́ться|pf|impf=-}}

# to [[walk]] for a long time
# to [[tire]] oneself by walking

=====Conjugation=====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c|находи́ться}}

===See also===
* {{l|ru|найти́сь}}
